    LLM: 'Game: Bieten. Deck: 33 German cards + WELI (wild). Categories: Rot, Grun, Gleich, Hanger, Spiel. Bet or Concede per category. No trump.',
    Player: "You hold the WELI, the King of Hearts, and the 9 of Bells. Bieten on 'Rot' (Best Heart) claiming the WELI is the Ace of Hearts! Your King alone is already competitive. If they call your bluff, you reveal the WELI truly is an Ace.",
    objective: 'Score the most points across 5 categories: Best Heart (Rot), Best Leaf (GrÃ¼n), Best Pair/Triple (Gleich), Best Sequence (Hanger), and the Last Trick (Spiel).',
    gameplay: "Starting with best hand, players may 'Bieten' (bet) on any category they wish to contest. Any opposing player can either: Concede (auto-lose the category, worth its base value) OR Call (match the bet, escalating the point value). At showdown, the best hand wins the doubled/escalated value.",
